  // NewReviewer returns the AgentReviewer for codex.
  //
  // Argv shape: codex exec review [--base <ref>] --uncommitted --json
  // --skip-git-repo-check -. Custom review instructions (entire's composed
  // prompt minus /review and the explicit scope clause) are piped via stdin.
  // Scope is carried by --base / --uncommitted flags.
  //
